{'symbol': 'ON', 'date': '2019-10-09 22:30:00', 'title': 'ORANGE FRANCE SELECTS WI-FI CHIPSET FROM ON SEMICONDUCTOR FOR NEW LIVEBOX 5 GATEWAY', 'text': 'ON SEMICONDUCTOR HAS ANNOUNCED THAT ORANGE FRANCE HAS ONCE AGAIN SELECTED ON SEMICONDUCTOR FOR ITS LATEST GATEWAY, LIVEBOX 5. THE NEW GATEWAY BOASTS UP TO 2GBPS SPEED, MAKING IT EASY AND CONVENIENT FOR ALL FAMILY MEMBERS TO SHARE THE CONNECTION TO ENJOY THEIR FAVORITE CONNECTED DEVICES AND MOST DEMANDING APPLICATIONS. IT ALSO COMES WITH A COMPACT DESIGN MADE OF RECYCLED PLASTICS AND HAS AN OVERALL CARBON FOOTPRINT LOWERED BY NEARLY THIRTY PERCENT COMPARED TO THE PREVIOUS GENERATION. LEVERAGING THE SUPERIOR PERFORMANCE OF ON SEMICONDUCTOR’S WI-FI CHIPSET, LIVEBOX 5 IS DESIGNED TO DELIVER AN EXCEPTIONAL AND FLAWLESS WI-FI EXPERIENCE TO CUSTOMERS, WHILE REDUCING ENVIRONMENTAL IMPACT.'}{'symbol': 'ON', 'date': '2019-10-09 19:30:00', 'title': 'ON SEMICONDUCTOR SAYS ON OCT 4, ENTERED BINDING TERM SHEET WITH POWER INTEGRATIONS', 'text': "ON SEMICONDUCTOR - ON OCT 4, CO ENTERED BINDING TERM SHEET WITH POWER INTEGRATIONS.ON SEMICONDUCTOR - PERSUANT TO AGREEMENT, PARTIES AGREED TO WITHDRAW ALL OUTSTANDING LEGAL & ADMINISTRATIVE DISPUTES.ON SEMICONDUCTOR CORP -  PURSUANT TO TERM SHEET, COMPANY AGREED TO PAY POWER INTEGRATIONS $175.0 MILLION IN CASH.ON SEMICONDUCTOR - EACH PARTY AGREED TO RELEASE OTHER PARTY FROM CLAIMS TO DAMAGES OR MONETARY RELIEF FOR ALLEGED ACTS OF PATENT INFRINGEMENT.ON SEMICONDUCTOR CORP -  COMPANY BELIEVES THAT SETTLEMENT WILL LIKELY RESULT IN MEANINGFUL COST SAVINGS DUE TO THE ELIMINATION OF LITIGATION COSTS..ON SEMICONDUCTOR CORP - EACH PARTY AGREED NOT TO FILE ANY ADDITIONAL ACTION FOR LEGAL OR EQUITABLE RELIEF FOR A NUMBER OF YEARS.ON SEMICONDUCTOR - PARTIES AGREED TO MEMORIALIZE TERMS OF TERM SHEET IN A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT BY NO LATER THAN OCTOBER 22.ON SEMICONDUCTOR - EXPECTS TO RECOGNIZE ONE-TIME CHARGE RELATING TO SETTLEMENT WITH POWER INTEGRATIONS IN QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 27, 2019.ON SEMICONDUCTOR - CHARGE IS EXPECTED TO ADVERSELY IMPACT CO'S GAAP RESULTS OF OPERATIONS."}